! DHW draw flow rate: sinusoidal base load plus morning peak from forcing function. M_dot [kg/hr]; from [8,1] Average value of function [kg/hr]; to -> [7,4] Cold-side flowrate [kg/hr]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
     M_dot = 50*SIN(TIME*10) + 100 + 2*[8,1]
